==About==
The '''2026 Reload Elite Series Championship''' is an inaugural Global Championship for the Reload game mode. '''Fortnite Reload''' was also announced as part of the '''Esports World Cup''' line-up on December 17, 2025.<ref name="EWC FN">{{Cite web|url=https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/make-your-way-to-the-esports-world-cup-in-fortnites-2-500-000-reload-elite-series/ymf0|title=Make Your Way to the Esports World Cup in Fortnite’s $2,500,000 Reload Elite Series |date=2025-12-17 |author=Epic Games|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>. It was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, but was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>

:''See [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2026|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2026, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

===Format===
<section begin="Format Group Stage"/><!--
-->*'''Group Stage''' - ''August 19<sup>th</sup> - 20<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** 40 teams divided into 2 groups.
*** 10 games per group.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 7 teams</span> of each group advance to [[Reload_Elite_Series/2026#Finals|Finals]].
** <span class="bg-stay">Top 8-17 teams</span> of each group drop to [[Reload_Elite_Series/2026/Survival Stage|Survival Stage]].
** <span class="bg-down">Bottom 3 teams</span> of each group are eliminated.<section end="Format Group Stage"/>
<section begin="Format Survival Stage"/><!--
-->*'''Survival Stage''' - ''August 21<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** 20 Teams.
*** 10 games to score maximum of points.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 6 teams</span> advance to [[Reload_Elite_Series/2026#Finals|Finals]].
** <span class="bg-down">Bottom 14 teams</span> are eliminated.<section end="Format Survival Stage"/>
<section begin="Format Finals"/><!--
-->*'''Finals''' - ''August 22<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** The 20 remaining teams will compete in the [[Reload_Elite_Series/2026/Match Point Format|Match Point Format]] - The first team to hit '''350 points''' AND then secure a {{Victory Crown}} '''Victory Royale''' in upcoming matches will be crowned as the winner. The remaining teams will be ranked by total points awarded in the series.
*** 15 games maximum.<section end="Format Finals"/>

